<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores in the Supersport</p>
<p>Series cricket matches played on Monday:</p>
<p>In Kimberley (day four): Northern Transvaal 363 and 185,</p>
<p>Griqualand West 541-6 dec (Pieter Barnard 212, Willie Dry 74,</p>
<p>Brett Benkenstein 62 not out) and 10-0. Griqualand West won by</p>
<p>ten wicets.</p>
<p>In Johannesburg (day three): Transvaal 371 and 263-8 (Ken</p>
<p>Rutherford 126 not out), Western Province 227 and 59-2.</p>
</text>
